//!
//! The target is slot 8,626,176, the **first Capella block**: Capella's own
//! first slot (8,626,174) and the one after it were both missed, so the
//! chain's first post-Capella block is two slots late. Its summary index is
//! 295 -- the first entry `historical_summaries` ever had.
